    </header>
	<main class="flex flex-col justify-start p-12">
		<div class="main flex flex-col">
			<div class="header">
			  <img src="/dustinvorac.jpg" alt="Profile" class="rounded" />
			  <h1 class="font-semibold text-2xl">I'm Dustin Vorac 👋 .</h1>
			</div>
			<section class="headlines flex flex-col gap-4">
			  <p>I live in <b>Chicago</b>. 🐻🌭</p>
			  <p>
				I'm a career software engineer. I specialize in building <b
				  >React and GraphQL frontends</b
				> for business of all sizes. I have lots or previous experience building
				APIs in Java Spring, and Ruby on Rails.
			  </p>
			  <p>
				I also love <b>mentoring junior developers</b>, and leading software
				teams to deliver products of all kinds.
			  </p>
			  <p>
				You can see my <a href="/dustin-vorac-resume.pdf">resume</a> or <a
				  href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dustin-vorac/">linkedin profile</a
				> for more details.
			  </p>
			  <p>
				I enjoy exploring food and restaurants in Chicago and reading about
				copyright and patent law, especially as it relates to software. I also
				enjoy playing board games, especially resource-strategy and
				engine-building games.
			  </p>
			  <p>I've recently got a puppy! 🐶💖</p>
			</section>
			<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold py-8">Projects</h1>
			<section class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 max-w-[100%]">
				<a href="https://github.com/dvorac/ukol" target="_blank" class="card flex-1 min-w-[calc(50%-8px)] block max-w-sm p-6 bg-(--dv-white) border border-gray-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-gray-700 dark:hover:bg-gray-700">
					<h5 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-semibold">úkol</h5>
					<p class="font-normal">A small toy to-do app. I use this app to develop skills in Terraform, Github Actions, and CI/CD practices in general.</p>
				</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/dvorac/dustinvoracdotcom" target="_blank" class="card flex-1 min-w-[calc(50%-8px)] block max-w-sm p-6 bg-(--dv-white) border border-gray-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-gray-700 dark:hover:bg-gray-700">
					<h5 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-semibold">dustinvoracdotcom</h5>
					<p class="font-normal">This website, built with Astro and plain HTML and TailwindCSS. Published to AWS automatically with Terraform.</p>
				</a>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
    <footer class="p-2 flex justify-center content-center">
      <div class="foottext">
        This page was built with 0 Javascript by <a href="https://astro.build/"
          >Astro</a
        > 🚀, and deployed automatically with <a
          href="https://www.terraform.io/">Terraform</a
        > 🐢. Sourcecode on <a
          href="https://github.com/dvorac/dustinvoracdotcom">Github</a
        >.
	  </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
  }

  .main {
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1em;
    max-width: 80ch;
  }

  .header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2em;
    margin-bottom: 2em;
  }

  .rounded {
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 50%;
    height: 8rem;
    width: 8rem;
  }

  .headlines p {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: large;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .links a img {
    height: 2rem;
    width: 2rem;
  }

  .foottext {
	font-weight: 200;
	font-size: small;
  }
</style>
